  "editorial": {
    "text": "Not much happening in libraries this week – just the normal council doublespeak, refurbishments and echoes from previous cuts. And my oldest daughter is home from Bangor, where she has just finished at university, so I’m not going to worry too much about writing too much and going to speak to her instead. Have a good week everyone.",
    "html": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Not much happening in libraries this week &#8211; just the normal council doublespeak, refurbishments and echoes from previous cuts. And my oldest daughter is home from Bangor, where she has just finished at university, so I&#8217;m not going to worry too much about writing too much and going to speak to her instead. Have a good week everyone.</p>"
